+---
+title: 'Reconcile workspace browser coverage with approved UI behavior'
+type: 'bugfix'
+created: '2026-09-04'
+status: 'in-review'
+baseline_commit: '717c75897cc04256c008a2ed42747df66f6fc6b5'
